{"strongs": "H0676", "word": "אֶצְבַּע", "translit": "ets.ba", "root": "צבע", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "finger", "definition": "אֶצְבַּע noun feminine Lev 14:6 finger ; — ׳ א absolute Isa 58:9 , construct Exod 8:15 +; suffix אֶצְבָּעוֺ Lev 4:6 +; plural אֶצְבָּעוֺת Jer 52:21 , construct אֶצְבְּעֹת 2Sam 21:20 +, etc.; — 1. finger , especially \\ \\ a. forefinger , of priest, applying blood ( P ), Exod 29:12 ; Lev 4:6 ; Lev 4:17 ; Lev 4:25 + 8 t.; applying oil Lev 14:16 (twice in verse); Lev 14:27 . \\ \\ b. ׳ שְׁלַח א of any one Isa 58:9 , sign of contempt. \\ \\ c. of God, as writing Exod 31:18 ( E ) Deut 9:10 = act of God Exod 8:15 ( J ). \\ \\ d. plural of all the fingers 2Sam 21:20 a; fingers in general Isa 2:8 ; Isa 17:8 ; Isa 59:3 ; Ps 144:1 ; Prov 7:3 ; Song 5:5 of ׳ י Ps 8:4 ׳ מֹרֶה בְא Prov 6:13 (of contemptuous gesture); as measure of thickness, Jer 52:21 four fingers . 2. toes: אֶצְבְּעֹת רַגְלָיו 2Sam 21:20 b, literally fingers of his feet , compare ׳ א || 1Chr 20:6 = fingers and toes.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6925')\">BDB6925</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H676')\">H676</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6924')\">BDB6924</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6926')\">BDB6926</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֶצְבַּע</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Lev 14:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,6)\">Lev 14:6</ref></sup> <highlightword>finger</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 58:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,9)\">Isa 58:9</ref>, construct <ref ref=\"Exod 8:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,15)\">Exod 8:15</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אֶצְבָּעוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 4:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,6)\">Lev 4:6</ref> +; plura