egin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,15)\">Exod 8:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> plural <highlightword>of all the fingers</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,20)\">2Sam 21:20</ref>a; fingers in general <ref ref=\"Isa 2:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,8)\">Isa 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 17:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,8)\">Isa 17:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,3)\">Isa 59:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 144:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,1)\">Ps 144:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 7:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,3)\">Prov 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 5:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,5)\">Song 5:5</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,4)\">Ps 8:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֹרֶה בְא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,13)\">Prov 6:13</ref> (of contemptuous gesture); as measure of thickness, <ref ref=\"Jer 52:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,21)\">Jer 52:21</ref> <highlight>four fingers</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>toes:</highlight> <bdbheb>אֶצְבְּעֹת רַגְלָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,20)\">2Sam 21:20</ref> b, literally <highlight>fingers of his feet</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> || <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:6\" b=\"1